== ADR-0012: an element target `V[I] += 1` is allowed only when its indices
== have no side effects; `V[Next] += 1` would call Next twice.
Next Integer :
    Return 1
;

Main :
    V Array[1..3] Integer
    V[Next] += 1
    PutLn(V[1])
;
